	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 最終決戦でハヤテが搭乗したVF-31ジークフリードが1/72可変モデルで待望のキット化！",
			"• 大人気キャラ「フレイア・ヴィオン」が描かれたルンピカVer.デカルチャーデカールが付属する豪華版仕様で登場!!",
			"• メッサーへの思いが込められた、ハヤテ専用のマーキングも再現！ 三形態に対応したマーキング＆デカールが付属。",
			"• 複雑な変形機構を支えるボディ構造には、一部に金属シャフトを使用。各部に内蔵したロック機構により、各形態を安定して保持することが可能。",
			"• コックピットは複座・単座の選択式。フレイアと共に搭乗する様子も再現可能！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• The long-awaited VF-31 Siegfried, which Hayate piloted in the final battle, has been made into a 1/72 variable model kit!",
			"• Now available in a deluxe version that comes with Lumpika Ver. Deculture decal depicting the popular character \"Freya Wion\"!!",
			"• Hayate's exclusive markings, which reflect his feelings for Messer, are also reproduced! Markings and decals compatible with the three forms are included.",
			"• Part of the body structure that supports the complex deformation mechanism uses a metal shaft. Lock mechanisms built into each part allow each form to be held stably.",
			"• The cockpit is selectable between two-seater and single-seater. You can also recreate the appearance of boarding with Freya!"
		]
	},
